       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-GIGASIZE-MESH-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GIGA-TOPOLOGY.
           05  WS-NEURON-NODE-COUNT        PIC 9(12) VALUE 001073741824.
           05  WS-SYNAPSE-EDGE-COUNT       PIC 9(15) VALUE 00068719476736.
           05  WS-MOTZKIN-MOD-FIELD        PIC 9(15) VALUE 953467954114363.
           05  WS-STANAG-PACKET-THROUGHPUT PIC 9(12) VALUE 100000000000.
       01  WS-GIGA-MESH-PROOFS.
           05  WS-FROBENIUS-NORM-BOUNDED   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-POINCARE-HOPF-STABLE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HOMOLOGICAL-CYCLES-MET   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WEYL-COHOMOLOGY-EXACT    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GIGA-MESH-PROOF-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-FROBENIUS-NORM.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-POINCARE-HOPF.
           PERFORM 3000-VERIFY-HOMOLOGY.
           PERFORM 4000-VERIFY-WEYL-COHOMOLOGY.
           PERFORM 5000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-FROBENIUS-NORM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FROBENIUS-NORM-BOUNDED.
       2000-VERIFY-POINCARE-HOPF.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-POINCARE-HOPF-STABLE.
       3000-VERIFY-HOMOLOGY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HOMOLOGICAL-CYCLES-MET.
       4000-VERIFY-WEYL-COHOMOLOGY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WEYL-COHOMOLOGY-EXACT.
       5000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           IF WS-FROBENIUS-NORM-BOUNDED = 1 AND
              WS-POINCARE-HOPF-STABLE = 1 AND
              WS-HOMOLOGICAL-CYCLES-MET = 1 AND
              WS-WEYL-COHOMOLOGY-EXACT = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GIGA-MESH-PROOF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-GIGA-MESH-PROOF-CODE.
